    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Cik ma mako kwoŋ two dhowo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwoth owaco ri Musa kodi Aron ama: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dhano nitie kodi gim'okwot, bur kosa gim'othon i delkwoŋe to lokere two dhowo i delkwoŋe, nyaka inyalo kelo go bongi Aron jacway ri Were i wi migam kosa bongi acel kwoŋ wote ma jobedo jocway ri Were i wi migam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacway ri Were i wi migam bino kikaŋasa two manitie i delkwoŋe, aka ka yer mar'adec ma two omako olokere matar, to two neno maluth loyo pien ma delkwoŋe, obedo two dhowo; ka jacway ri Were i wi migam otieko kikaŋasa go, latuco ni go olony. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To k'adec ma pien ma delkwoŋe tar, aka kicale pa thuth loyo pien, aka yer ma kwoŋe fodi k'olokere matar, jacway ri Were i wi migam lakano jatwo ma ndelo abirio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacway ri Were i wi migam bino kikaŋasa i ndelo mar'abirio, aka k'oneno ni otiek kikaŋasa two aka fodi k'onyay i pien, to jacway ri Were i wi migam medo kano go ma ndelo abirio man. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacway ri Were i wi migam lakikaŋasa go kendo i ndelo mar'abirio, aka ka two oleny aka fodi k'olak i pien, jacway ri Were i wi migam latuco ni go olony; obedo nyaka gim'otula; go lalwoko nangin pere, to bedo m'olony. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka kam'otawa onyay i pien ka go otieko nyuthere ri jacway ri Were i wi migam ri lonyo pere, go lanyuthere kendo ri jacway ri Were i wi migam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacway ri Were i wi migam bino kikaŋasa go kendo, aka ka kam'otawa no otiek lak i pien, jacway ri Were i wi migam latuco ni go k'olony; obedo two dhowo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka two dhowo omako dhano, ilakelo go bongi jacway ri Were i wi migam; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jacway ri Were i wi migam bino kikaŋasa go, aka ka nitie gim'okwot matar i pien m'oloko yer matar, aka nitie ringo manumu madongo piyo kam'okwot, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obedo dhowo makicangi i pien ma delkwoŋe, aka jacway ri Were i wi migam latuco ni go koc; go k'ocegi go, rupiri go koc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka dhowo obino abwap i pien, m'onyalo umo pien pa jadhowo gipi wok i wiye kiri i tiende, ma jacway ri Were nyalo neno, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyaka jacway ri Were i wi migam bino kikaŋasa, aka ka dhowo oumo kwoŋe gipi, go latuco ni go olony paka gino otieko lokere je matar, go olony. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka ringo manumu omenyere kwoŋe, go labedo makoc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka jacway ri Were i wi migam bino kikaŋasa ringo manumu, to tuco ni go koc; ringo manumu koc, kole obedo dhowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka ringo manumu olokere kendo matar, go labino bongi jacway ri Were i wi migam; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jacway ri Were i wi migam bino kikaŋasa go, aka ka two olokere matar, jacway ri Were i wi migam latuco ni jatwo olony. Go olony.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ka nitie i pien ma delkwoŋ nyatoro bur m'ocango, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka i kabedo pa bur to menyere gima kwot matar kosa kamoro m'obokere matar, iripo nyutho jacway ri Were i wi migam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To jacway ri Were i wi migam bino kikaŋasa, aka ka neno pa luth loyo pien, aka yer mere otieko lokere matar, nyaka to jacway ri Were i migam latuco ni go koc; obedo two ma dhowo, m'ocakere i bur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka jacway ri Were i wi migam okaŋasa aka yer ma wiye kitar, kosa kiluth loyo pien, to bedo ma nimnim, jacway ri Were i wi migam lacego go ma ndelo abirio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'onyay i pien, jacway ri Were i wi migam latuco ni go koc; two omako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To k'adec no odoŋ i kabedo acel aka kinyay, obedo alama ma bur; jacway ri Were i wi migam latuco ni go olony.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kosa, ka del nitie g'awaŋa i pien to ringo manumu mar'awaŋa lokere kam'otawa, m'obokere matar kosa matar, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jacway ri Were i wi migam lakikaŋasa. Ka yer ma kam'otawa otieko lokere matar aka neno thuth loyo pien, meno dhowo; otieko cakere i waŋ, aka jacway ri Were i wi migam latuco ni go koc. Obedo two dhowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka jacway ri Were okaŋasa to yer ma kam'otawa k'obedo matar, aka kithuth loyo pien to nimnim, jacway ri Were i wi migam lacego go ma ndelo abirio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacway ri Were i wi migam bino kikaŋasa go i ndelo mar'abirio; ka nyay i pien, jacway ri Were i wi migam latuco ni go koc. Obedo two dhowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka poyo no odoŋ i kabedo acel to bedo ma k'onyay i pien to bedo ma nimnim, meno adhola m'owok i waŋ, aka jacway ri Were i wi migam, latuco ni go koc; kole meno poyo ma waŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka jacwo kosa dhako nitie gi two i wiye kosa i ye tike, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jacway ri Were i wi migam bino kikaŋasa two no. Ka nenere ni thuth loyo pien aka yer ma iye obedo manyatongweno aka olwiriri, jacway ri Were i wi migam latuco ni go koc; obedo gima yilo jo, dhowo ma wic kosa ma ye tik jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.30",
