              "LEV.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka ka jacway ri Were i wi migam okaŋasa two ma yilo jo no to nenere ni kithuth loyo pien aka ongoye yer macol iye, jacway ri Were i wi migam bino cego ŋata nitie gi two ma yilo jo ma ndelo abirio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndelo mar'abirio, jacway ri Were i wi migam bino kikaŋasa ŋwenyirok; aka ka ŋwenyirok fodi k'onyay, aka ongoye yer manyatongweno iye, aka ŋwenyirok kicale pa thuth loyo pien, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "go lalielo wiye kwanyowoko adec macegin g'adhola. Jacway ri Were i wi migam kenyo lapano go ma ndelo abirio man. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndelo mar'abirio, jacway ri Were i wi migam bino kikaŋasa adhola pere kendo, aka kafodi k'onyay aka kicale pa thuth loyo pien m'othoko, go latuco ni go olony. Ŋato lalwoko nangin pere, to lokere m'olony. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To ka ŋwenyirok onyay k'otiek tuco ni go olony, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jacway ri Were i wi migam bino kikaŋasa go. Ka ŋwenyirok otieko nyay i pien, jacway ri Were i wi migam kiripi dwaro yer manyatongweno, ŋato, olony. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To k'otemi neno ŋwenyirok i waŋe, aka yer macol odoŋ'iye, ŋwenyirok ocango, ŋato olony; aka jacway ri Were i wi migam latuco ni go olony.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
