          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma mako nangin: Ka nitie two dhowo i nanga, obedi mafoth pa pien rombo kosa law, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "i wiy nyawote, kosa ma law kosa nanga ma yer rombo kosa i pien kosa i kisi gimoro je m'otimi gi pien, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka two onyuthere manyaboke pendi kosa m'obokere i nanga, kam'odole, kosa ma pien, kosa i pien, kosa i gimoro je m'otimi gi pien, obedo two dhowo aka iripo nyutho jacway ri Were i wi migam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka jacway ri Were i wi migam bino kikaŋasa two, to cego kama nitie two no ma ndelo abirio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jacway ri Were i wi migam bino kikaŋasa two i ndelo mar'abirio. Ka two otieko nyay i nanga, kam'odole, kosa i pien, kad'obedi ni pien ioro ma ginaŋo, obedo two dhowo ma nyay, koc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go bino waŋo nanga, obedi ni two nitie kam'odole, gima nyayer rombo kosa law, kosa i gimoro je m'otimi gi pien, obedo dhowo ma nyay, iripo waŋo i mac.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
