          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka jacway ri Were i wi migam okaŋasa, to two lokere ma nimnim munyo otiek lwoko, go ripo yeco adec kwoŋ nanga, i kam'odole kosa kwoŋ pien. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.56"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "57",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:57"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "57",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'onenere kendo i nanga, i kam'odole, kosa i gimoro je ma pien, meno nyay; iripo waŋo gi mac gino kama two nener'iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.57",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.57"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "58",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 13:58"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "58",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To nanga, kam'odole, kosa gimoro je m'otimi gi pien ma two nener'iye k'itieko lwoko, nyaka ibino lwoko madirio, aka bino bedo m'olony.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.13.58",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.13.58"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
